    "keyboard": {},
    "aria": [
      "sb-table: role=table; header, body and footer: role=rowgroup; row: role=row; head: role=columnheader; cell: role=cell; caption: role=caption",
      "roles are set on the hosts before the first render; they resolve across shadow roots because the accessibility tree follows the flat tree",
      "the caption names the table through ElementInternals ariaLabelledByElements (same tree scope as the table, so it resolves); where unsupported, the caption text is copied into aria-label; an aria-label or aria-labelledby set by the author wins",
      "a selected row has aria-selected=true",
      "an author role attribute is kept on sb-table and can override a head or cell role (for example rowheader); the component sets a role only where the author set none"
    ],
